  "body": "## What changed\n\n- **Flutes for each kind.** The 3D preview of the tool library cuts flutes into each kind that has a cutting part with flutes (`flutes::fluted_kind`): end mill, ball nose, bull nose, chamfer (`Taper`), twist drill, tap, both thread mills, T-slot, keyseat, dovetail, lollipop and form mill. The lathe tools, the probe, the electrode and the beam and wire tools stay plain. The flute lines of the side view use the same rule.\n- **Counts.** The #3908 rule stays: a tool with no flute count draws no flutes. Two display defaults are new. A twist drill with no count draws 2 flutes at a 30 degree helix (DIN 338 type N). A tap with no count draws 3 straight flutes. The shipped drills and taps state no count. The tool keeps no count, and nothing is written.\n- **Thread mills.** The flutes are cut into the toothed steel of #4451. The Properties side preview (`tool_preview::paint` without a steel override) also draws the teeth now (`thread_form::toothed`).\n- **Finer mesh.** The preview revolve (`tool_library_dialog::model::RING`) has 96 facets around, not 32. The collision and body meshes do not change. The model is built only when its input changes. The screen mesh is projected only when the mesh, its parts, the rect, the orbit or the part inks change. A still frame builds nothing.\n- **Three part inks.** Three new theme tokens in `crates/ui-kit`: `tool_model_flute` (gold), `tool_model_shank` (steel grey) and `tool_model_holder` (slate blue). They are in the theme struct, both tables, the legal check, the names, the overlay, the gallery lists, `assets/themes/theme.json.example` and `docs/user-guide/themes.md`. The dark and light columns have the same values, as the other tool inks do: the previews keep their own dark ground. Each facet has the ink of its part, shaded by the light (45 % edge-on to 100 %). There is no colour literal in `crates/ui`.\n- Decision record: `docs/decisions/4452-preview-flutes-colours.md`.\n\nDisplay only: no change to toolpath, collision, simulation or posted output.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `egui_app::tool_library_dialog::flutes::tests::each_fluted_kind_shows_its_flutes` (one shipped tool of each fluted kind has a flute mesh, and the part above the flutes stays plain)\n- `egui_app::tool_library_dialog::flutes::tests::a_drill_and_a_tap_without_a_count_draw_their_kinds_flutes`\n- `egui_app::tool_library_dialog::flutes::tests::a_thread_mill_cuts_its_flutes_into_its_teeth`\n- `egui_app::tool_library_dialog::model::tests::each_fluted_kind_has_a_flute_mesh_in_the_preview`\n- `egui_app::tool_library_dialog::model::tests::the_preview_revolve_is_finer_than_before` (pins `RING` = 96)\n- `egui_app::tool_library_dialog::model::tests::each_facet_carries_its_part`\n- `egui_app::tool_library_dialog::model::tests::a_part_ink_is_shaded_by_the_light`\n- `egui_app::tool_library_dialog::preview::tests::a_part_ink_change_is_a_new_projection_key`\n- `theme_files::tool_inks::the_3d_preview_parts_have_three_theme_inks` (three different inks, each a theme key, each clears `contrast::UI` on `tool_ground`, dark and light)\n- Changed: `tools_without_flutes_draw_the_plain_model` (the T-slot, the dovetail and the thread mill now have flutes; the list holds plain kinds), and the envelope and facet-bound tests also run over each fluted kind.\n\n## Gate\n\nThe parent #4458 merged to `main`. Head `090d3c74db5d042ee78deb138db36a1ddfb1b1f8` merges `origin/main` into the branch with no conflict and no hand edit.\n\n- Quick gate on head `090d3c74db5d042ee78deb138db36a1ddfb1b1f8` (winbuild lane, `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main`): 15 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled. ui-kit lib, contrast, gallery; ui lib, boundary, boundary_picks, contour_dxf_sketch, sinker_setup, tap_hand, theme_example, theme_files, waterjet_tool. The step \"site tests\" is SKIPPED (python, zola and node are not on the winbuild lane). This is not a pass.\n- `cargo check -p camcraft-ui`: clean on the same head.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui -p camcraft-ui-kit --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean on the same head.\n- `#[test]` count of `crates/ui` + `crates/ui-kit`: 2026 on `main`, 2036 on the merged head. (Before the merge: 2021 on the parent, 2030 on this branch.)\n- No toolpath or post changed, so no example catalog suite. No light lane step reaches this diff.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- No pixel snapshot PNG changed. The release lane takes the new look at the cut.\n- The frame time on a real GPU was not measured. The facet count of the plain steel is about 3 times larger; the fluted steel was already at 96 facets around.\n- The library thumbnails (`thumbs.rs`) keep their two inks.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nThe tool library window, 3D view, Holder and Flutes on. Before: parent head `b20e12ace`. After: head `0526ba775` (the merge of `main` changes no file of this PR).\n\n**dark, EM-1000-4FL**\n\n![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/before-dark-EM-1000-4FL.png)\n![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/after-dark-EM-1000-4FL.png)\n\n**dark, KS-1600-0300**\n\n![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/before-dark-KS-1600-0300.png)\n![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/after-dark-KS-1600-0300.png)\n\n**dark, DT-2000-60**\n\n![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/before-dark-DT-2000-60.png)\n![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/after-dark-DT-2000-60.png)\n\n**dark, DR-0600**\n\n![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/before-dark-DR-0600.png)\n![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/after-dark-DR-0600.png)\n\n**dark, TM-0600-P125**\n\n![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/before-dark-TM-0600-P125.png)\n![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/after-dark-TM-0600-P125.png)\n\n**light, EM-1000-4FL**\n\n![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/before-light-EM-1000-4FL.png)\n![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/after-light-EM-1000-4FL.png)\n\n**light, KS-1600-0300**\n\n![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/before-light-KS-1600-0300.png)\n![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/after-light-KS-1600-0300.png)\n\n**light, DT-2000-60**\n\n![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/before-light-DT-2000-60.png)\n![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/after-light-DT-2000-60.png)\n\n**light, DR-0600**\n\n![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/before-light-DR-0600.png)\n![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/after-light-DR-0600.png)\n\n**light, TM-0600-P125**\n\n![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/before-light-TM-0600-P125.png)\n![after](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/qsmits/Camcraft/pr-screenshots/4466/after-light-TM-0600-P125.png)\n\n\nChangelog: The 3D tool preview shows flutes for each tool kind with a cutting part (also keyseat, T-slot, dovetail, lollipop, form mill, thread mill, drill and tap), a smoother revolved mesh, and three theme inks for the holder, the shank and the flutes (`tool_model_holder`, `tool_model_shank`, `tool_model_flute`).\n\nEffort: high\n\nFixes #4452\n\n",
